__pycache__
.venv
models/*.gguf
checkpoints/
runs/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info
*.whl
*.tar.gz
*.pth
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
train_report.json
*.pdf
*.png
emissions.csv
*.npz
*.json

# Measured evidence is version-controlled; only build output is ignored.
!configs/*.json
!benchmark_report.json
!outputs/*.json

# docs/images/*.png is deliberately NOT un-ignored.
#
# A short smoke run writes all five baseline figures, so a blanket negation let a
# 4-step plot be committed next to a claim of 600 steps. A plot is only evidence
# for the run that produced it, so figures stay ignored until a full run's JSON is
# committed, and are then added deliberately with `git add -f` after checking the
# image against its JSON.
